{
  "name": "Creator Lead Identity Review Pipeline Demo",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Public synthetic workflow\n\nThis demo does not include confidential company data, private workflows, credentials, client information, production screenshots, real lead records, private prompts, or private API endpoints.\n\nIt shows workflow design for SQL-backed identity resolution, local enrichment API separation, human review, operational handoff, and reliability.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 4320,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "268bee9d-7446-4cfc-bccc-56d5964c1737",
      "name": "Public Safety Banner",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        112,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. SQL Source Queue\n\nRaw source rows are staged before becoming canonical leads.\n\nSource rows are import events, not identity truth.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 430,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "efd99793-d8fd-443e-85b7-e84cd5cab0de",
      "name": "SQL Source Queue Lane",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        112,
        288
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Identifier Normalization\n\nProfile URLs and handles are normalized before lookup.\n\nStrong identifiers can resolve identity. Weak attributes cannot auto-merge records.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "69b8c46b-05cc-41ba-8b93-8577f752dad1",
      "name": "Identifier Normalization Lane",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        576,
        288
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. SQL Identity Registry\n\nStrong identifiers map to canonical UUIDs.\n\nUnique constraints prevent duplicate identity claims.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "18b60f29-e629-4ce9-bab5-de7c31756f1b",
      "name": "SQL Identity Registry Lane",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1104,
        288
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. Conflict Handling\n\nAmbiguous matches are written to a conflict record.\n\nThe workflow does not silently merge multiple UUID matches.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "0fe2e126-6a3e-49e8-864f-a41f4a080a79",
      "name": "Conflict Handling Lane",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1696,
        288
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5. Local Enrichment API Adapter\n\nThe workflow calls enrichment through an API boundary instead of embedding all LLM logic directly in n8n.\n\nThis public demo uses a synthetic mock response contract.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 544,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "e6278b8d-0781-46ea-859d-0315ffa903f3",
      "name": "Local API Lane",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2288,
        288
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 6. Human Review Gate\n\nAI enrichment is a draft recommendation.\n\nA reviewer approves, rejects, or returns the record for revision.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 430,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "38fa34c3-936f-48bb-8e49-5f6d6d20cbe0",
      "name": "Human Review Lane",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2864,
        288
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 7. SQL Export State\n\nBefore handoff, the workflow checks whether this UUID has already been exported to the destination.\n\nDuplicate exports become no-op results.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "f8a327fb-60d8-4589-b032-676a69a17473",
      "name": "SQL Export State Lane",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3328,
        288
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 8. Ops / Health Checks\n\nSynthetic checks summarize unresolved conflicts, approved-not-exported records, and duplicate export attempts.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "471c6ad7-b43a-4c3c-a05f-6537de443269",
      "name": "Ops Checks Lane",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3984,
        288
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
